        "original_id": "7685764d-0640-56c5-b767-cda100013f03",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rosey Grier, Darby Hinton, Fess Parker, Daniel Boone\n- TV Series: Daniel Boone\n- Organizations: NBC, Pennsylvania State University, National Collegiate Athletic Association\n- Roles: Gabe Cooper, Israel Boone\n\nFacts:\n- From 1964 to 1970, Darby Hinton portrayed Israel Boone, a son of Daniel Boone, on the NBC adventure series \"Daniel Boone.\"\n- During Darby Hinton's run on \"Daniel Boone,\" Fess Parker played the title role of Daniel Boone.\n- In the 1969 to 1970 season of \"Daniel Boone,\" actor and former NFL player Rosey Grier made regular appearances as Gabe Cooper.\n- Rosey Grier was a notable college football player for Pennsylvania State University.\n- Rosey Grier later earned a retrospective place on the National Collegiate Athletic Association's 100th anniversary list of 100 most influential student athletes.",
